time... [laughing]


01:45:56.707 --> 01:45:58.078
Okay, I'm locking in.


01:45:58.214 --> 01:46:00.178
We have to find her.


01:46:00.313 --> 01:46:01.248
But until then...


01:46:01.384 --> 01:46:03.178
[Lohan] Until then, what?


01:46:03.313 --> 01:46:05.273
[laughing] I don't know
why I keep going... [gasps]


01:46:05.356 --> 01:46:08.457
♪ <i>Pissin' the night away</i> ♪


01:46:08.592 --> 01:46:10.111
-[crew laughing]
-[crew member] I can't. Sorry.


01:46:10.194 --> 01:46:12.621
♪ <i>Danny Boy</i> ♪


01:46:12.757 --> 01:46:14.122
[crew continues laughing]


01:46:14.257 --> 01:46:16.795
[director] Okay, Jamie,
reach for the enema box.


01:46:17.197 --> 01:46:18.326
[laughs]


01:46:18.462 --> 01:46:20.535
Mm. Mmm.


01:46:21.432 --> 01:46:22.436
Mmm.


01:46:22.572 --> 01:46:24.204
-She's had 29 doughnuts.
-[both chuckle]


01:46:24.340 --> 01:46:25.501
Just give me the doughnut.


01:46:25.637 --> 01:46:26.744
You're prediabetic.


01:46:26.880 --> 01:46:29.137
[gasps] What's that?


01:46:32.183 --> 01:46:33.201
Not supposed to eat those.


01:46:33.284 --> 01:46:35.644
You learned a lesson. [laughs]


01:46:36.080 --> 01:46:37.981
My God, I could
be a pirate, huh?


01:46:38.116 --> 01:46:40.485
[in English accent]
Oh, you fancy that?


01:46:40.620 --> 01:46:41.752
Put on my jumper, eat my...


01:46:41.887 --> 01:46:43.852
-[all laugh]
-[Julia] I can't!


01:46:43.987 --> 01:46:46.257
You wanna fight?
I can fight too.


01:46:46.392 --> 01:46:47.522
Let's fight!


01:46:47.657 --> 01:46:49.133
Oh, my God.


01:46:49.269 --> 01:46:50.525
[students chanting] Let us out!


01:46:50.660 --> 01:46:51.829
Let us out!


01:46:51.965 --> 01:46:54.065
-Do you want to be fired?
-It's a hit.


01:46:54.201 --> 01:46:55.471
[laughs]


01:46:56.072 --> 01:46:57.240
[horn honks]


01:46:57.376 --> 01:46:59.077
Anna Louise Coleman,
do you think...


01:46:59.212 --> 01:47:02.111
[laughing] Is that
my middle name?


01:47:02.246 --> 01:47:03.914
Yes, it is your middle name.


01:47:04.050 --> 01:47:05.382
[Anna and Tess screaming]


01:47:09.990 --> 01:47:11.254
[Sherry] That's different.


01:47:11.390 --> 01:47:12.951
What's that? The
pink Power Ranger?


01:47:13.086 --> 01:47:15.654
[laughing] I'm kidding.
I'm kidding, I'm kidding.


01:47:15.790 --> 01:47:17.959
Let's not. Let's not. Let's not.


01:47:18.094 --> 01:47:19.825
Oh, my God!


01:47:21.200 --> 01:47:22.631
[George] What the hell is she?


01:47:22.766 --> 01:47:25.402
Was that a Pepto Bismol
comm... What is she doing?


01:47:27.271 --> 01:47:29.039
Here we are. In the pelvis.


01:47:29.174 --> 01:47:30.767
Like peanut butter molasses.


01:47:30.902 --> 01:47:32.844
-Yes.
-Peanut butter molasses.


01:47:32.980 --> 01:47:34.437
-Slow.
-[both laugh]


01:47:35.306 --> 01:47:38.474
Were any of those teenagers
a "Bad Boss Betty"?


01:47:38.610 --> 01:47:39.974
No. I'm sorry.


01:47:40.110 --> 01:47:42.187
-[spits]
-[Tess] Good. More.


01:47:42.322 --> 01:47:45.179
[Lohan laughing] That
really was so bad.


01:47:45.315 --> 01:47:47.490
[Jake] What are you
doing down there?


01:47:48.225 --> 01:47:49.452
Just crawling. [laughs]


01:47:49.587 --> 01:47:51.496
[crew laughing]


01:47:51.931 --> 01:47:53.029
Look at the road!


01:47:53.164 --> 01:47:54.663
-[screams]
-Oh!


01:47:55.466 --> 01:47:57.460
-I got caught!
-[crew member] Cut!


01:47:57.596 --> 01:47:59.161
That was fun.


01:47:59.296 --> 01:48:02.307
Thank you for watching.
We love you so much.


01:48:02.442 --> 01:48:04.874
-Thanks for coming.
-I think I just peed.


01:48:05.010 --> 01:48:06.806
[all laughing]


01:48:07.541 --> 01:48:08.577
[crew member] Okay, cut.

